Z||000001||Carver1||12-02-2000||09:33 PM||||Some caddies do that. Might want to check to see if that brake light would fit, or get the controller off of a caddy.??||||reg||1
Z||000002||WampusCat||12-03-2000||12:09 AM||||Signal Dynamics makes a module for this.  I had one on my last motorcycle and it worked great.  I think it was about $30. <A HREF="http://www.signaldynamics.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.signaldynamics.com/</A> <BR>You could probably just install a $2.00 flasher from Pep Boys on the wire to the brake light for a simple flasher.  This part # was listed on the Miata net. Tridon standard duty flasher, #536/552-C <P>Steve J.||||reg||1
Z||000003||theogre||12-03-2000||03:19 PM||||it would be cheaper for you to go buy the module at the above site then have someone custom build it. I know I wouldn't even consider it for less than $100. When you figure development and testing to make sure it's reliable it quite allot of time.||||reg||1
